-RQOS_72=Five priority classes with guaranteed minimums and per-class ceilings, shaped in hardware with PI2 AQM. Accelerator stays on.
-RQOS_73=Upload only
-RQOS_74=Classes + guarantees
-RQOS_75=Hardware QoS
-RQOS_76=Single hardware queue: one upload cap plus AQM. The simplest bufferbloat fix, no classes.
